# psi/test_espc.py Window test_win_m10_menu's EDITOR MENU (the pin
# M10_PINS['editor_menu'], docs/simpos/screens/editor_menu.png): exshow
# as in pmacs_editor.script, `Hi` typed, then ONE right click (it waits
# out the double-click time, so it is mouse#r, not mouse#rr) in the Pmacs
# window opens its EDITOR MENU (standard_editor.esp show_menu/1)
click r 640 560
click r 640 560
click l 978 605
quiet
start exshow
click l 200 150
type Hi
quiet
click r 300 200
quiet
